.terraform/

# turf per-directory state (session/memory dbs) — keep only the committed assets:
# the skill, turf.yaml, and the branding banner it references.
chat/.turf/*
!chat/.turf/skills/
!chat/.turf/turf.yaml
!chat/.turf/scalr-banner.txt

# The chat demo ships with NO plot: the agent config_inits a fresh plot each
# session, so config_init + declare_backend + the declares scaffold a .gitignore,
# *.tfplot.hcl units, and a local tfstate here. Keep them out of git so runs leave
# the checkout clean.
chat/.gitignore
chat/*.tfplot.hcl
chat/terraform.tfstate*
